            {
              "id": "/page/1/ListItem/209",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li block-type=\"ListItem\"> the conformity assessment procedures laid down in Annex IX and XI MDR/IVDR (e.g.  Annex IX, section 2.2 and 3.2 respectively).</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  90.07715606689453,
                  707.0248565673828
