        {
          "id": "/page/1/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\">As a consequence, EtO used for sterilisation during the manufacturing of medical devices and  IVDs is used for a process that falls within the regulatory obligations imposed by the MDR and</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              68.79059368296895,
              738.1518969922223
            ],
